0.005}},{"id":"RBC 2027 Q2","t":"RBC","d":"2026-10-30","time":"bmo","w":5974,"n":63,"url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/10/30/rbc-bearings-rbc-q2-2027-earnings-call-transcript/","lens":{"theater":[0,0,0,0.0],"cinema":[0,0,0,0.0],"imax":[0,0,0,0.0],"streaming":[0,0,0,0.0],"dtc":[0,0,0,0.0],"ai_spend":[0,0,0,0.0],"tariffs":[0,0,0,0.0],"pricing_power":[0,0,0,0.0],"cost_cuts":[0,0,0,0.0],"guidance":[1,1,0,1.72,{"raise":1,"reaffirm":0,"cut":0}]},"move":{"r1":-0.0676,"r5":-0.0624,"r1_spy":-0.0499,"r5_spy":-0.0152}}],"quotes":[{"c":"RBC 2018 Q3","e":"rbc","d":"2018-11-05","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Mark Gliebe","x":"The operating margin benefited from volume, incremental price and variable cost productivity, but was held back by commodity inflation and tariffs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/11/05/regal-beloit-corp-rbc-q3-2018-earnings-conference.aspx"},{"c":"RBC 2018 Q3","e":"rbc","d":"2018-11-05","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Mark Gliebe","x":"With regards to the tariffs, Jon will provide more details; however, the summary is that, with our mitigation plans, we expect to continue to offset the impact of tariffs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/11/05/regal-beloit-corp-rbc-q3-2018-earnings-conference.aspx"},{"c":"RBC 2018 Q3","e":"rbc","d":"2018-11-05","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Jonathan Schlemmer","x":"Across all the segments, we have implemented additional price increases over the past three months to offset the impact of the tariffs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/11/05/regal-beloit-corp-rbc-q3-2018-earnings-conference.aspx"},{"c":"RBC 2018 Q3","e":"rbc","d":"2018-11-05","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Bhupender Bohra","x":"The follow-up question here on the pricing, can you kind of give us like what was pricing in the quarter and how basically broke out between the NPS (ph) and the regular pass through, the spot price?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/11/05/regal-beloit-corp-rbc-q3-2018-earnings-conference.aspx"},{"c":"RBC 2018 Q3","e":"rbc","d":"2018-11-05","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Robert Rehard","x":"The first adjustment was restructuring and related costs of $2.3 million or $0.03 per share.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/11/05/regal-beloit-corp-rbc-q3-2018-earnings-conference.aspx"},{"c":"RBC 2018 Q3","e":"rbc","d":"2018-11-05","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Robert Rehard","x":"Our simplification activities resulted in $2.3 million of restructuring and related costs in the third quarter.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/11/05/regal-beloit-corp-rbc-q3-2018-earnings-conference.aspx"},{"c":"RBC 2018 Q4","e":"rbc","d":"2019-02-05","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Mark Gliebe","x":"The operating margin benefited from volume, incremental price and variable cost productivity, but was held back by commodity inflation and tariffs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/02/05/regal-beloit-corp-rbc-q4-2018-earnings-conference.aspx"},{"c":"RBC 2018 Q4","e":"rbc","d":"2019-02-05","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Mark Gliebe","x":"Further, we are making the needed investments in our tariff mitigation programs to help offset the impact of tariffs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/02/05/regal-beloit-corp-rbc-q4-2018-earnings-conference.aspx"},{"c":"RBC 2018 Q4","e":"rbc","d":"2019-02-05","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Jon Avampato","x":"But, it's kind of difficult to understand what the difference is there or what the impact is, given the variables on tariffs and price increase and whether this is kind of a little bit of a normal inventory build or just some buying ahead of the tariffs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/02/05/regal-beloit-corp-rbc-q4-2018-earnings-conference.aspx"},{"c":"RBC 2018 Q4","e":"rbc","d":"2019-02-05","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Jon Avampato","x":"We exited the year with a number of price increases that we implemented across all three segments, either in the late third quarter or early to mid fourth quarter.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/02/05/regal-beloit-corp-rbc-q4-2018-earnings-conference.aspx"},{"c":"RBC 2018 Q4","e":"rbc","d":"2019-02-05","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Rob Rehard","x":"The first adjustment was restructuring and related costs of $2.2 million or $0.04 per share.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/02/05/regal-beloit-corp-rbc-q4-2018-earnings-conference.aspx"},{"c":"RBC 2018 Q4","e":"rbc","d":"2019-02-05","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Rob Rehard","x":"Our simplification activities resulted in $2.2 million of restructuring and related costs in the fourth quarter.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/02/05/regal-beloit-corp-rbc-q4-2018-earnings-conference.aspx"},{"c":"RBC 2019 Q1","e":"rbc","d":"2019-05-07","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Rob Rehard","x":"The first investment was made to mitigate the impact of the China tariffs, and the second investment was made to help mitigate expected capacity constraints in the second half of the year due to the upcoming FER regulatory change in July.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/05/07/regal-beloit-rbc-q1-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"RBC 2019 Q1","e":"rbc","d":"2019-05-07","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Jon Schlemmer","x":"Price/cost was slightly favorable as price offset the commodity inflation and tariff expenses.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/05/07/regal-beloit-rbc-q1-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"RBC 2019 Q1","e":"rbc","d":"2019-05-07","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Rob Rehard","x":"The first adjustment was restructuring and related costs of $2.3 million or $0.04 per share.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/05/07/regal-beloit-rbc-q1-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"RBC 2019 Q1","e":"rbc","d":"2019-05-07","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Rob Rehard","x":"Our simplification activities resulted in $2.3 million of restructuring and related costs in the first quarter.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/05/07/regal-beloit-rbc-q1-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"RBC 2019 Q2","e":"rbc","d":"2019-08-06","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Louis Pinkham","x":"…lower-than-expected demand due to abnormally wet and mild weather, the ongoing global trade uncertainties, including the June Mexico tariff concerns; efforts by distribution partners to reduce channel inventories, along with an overall continued economic malaise in Asia Pacific and Europe.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/08/07/regal-beloit-rbc-q2-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"RBC 2019 Q2","e":"rbc","d":"2019-08-06","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Louis Pinkham","x":"While we do not see much of a direct impact from the tariffs in this segment, we do feel the indirect impacts on the markets we serve.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/08/07/regal-beloit-rbc-q2-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"RBC 2019 Q2","e":"rbc","d":"2019-08-06","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Louis Pinkham","x":"However, if we don't earn a reasonable margin, there are three choices: Regal becomes more market-competitive; we work with our customer to raise prices in a partnering fashion; or we exit the business and address our cost position.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/08/07/regal-beloit-rbc-q2-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"RBC 2019 Q2","e":"rbc","d":"2019-08-06","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Louis Pinkham","x":"Through this reorganization, we will incur some short-term restructuring costs, but the changes will improve performance, turn into cost savings and pay long-term dividends in the execution of the business.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/08/07/regal-beloit-rbc-q2-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"RBC 2019 Q2","e":"rbc","d":"2019-08-06","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Rob Rehard","x":"Our simplification activities resulted in $3.6 million of restructuring and related costs in the quarter.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/08/07/regal-beloit-rbc-q2-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"RBC 2019 Q3","e":"rbc","d":"2019-11-04","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Louis Pinkham","x":"As I've stated before, while we do not see much of a direct impact from the tariffs in this segment, we do feel the indirect impacts.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/11/04/regal-beloit-rbc-q3-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"RBC 2019 Q3","e":"rbc","d":"2019-11-04","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Louis Pinkham","x":"Although we have experienced some temporary tariff-related market share erosion, especially in our industrial motors business, we believe that our North American investments in assembly improve our cost competitiveness and give us a supply and service advantage with our customers going forward,…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/11/04/regal-beloit-rbc-q3-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"RBC 2019 Q3","e":"rbc","d":"2019-11-04","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Louis Pinkham","x":"While we are seeing a slightly positive inflection in fourth quarter order trends, we are still laser-focused on accelerating our restructuring efforts given the market conditions.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/11/04/regal-beloit-rbc-q3-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"RBC 2019 Q3","e":"rbc","d":"2019-11-04","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Louis Pinkham","x":"The reorganization that we announced last quarter, along with our restructuring efforts, have already resulted in a 16% reduction in personnel and a 17% reduction in SG&A costs compared to the prior year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/11/04/regal-beloit-rbc-q3-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"RBC 2019 Q4","e":"rbc","d":"2020-02-04","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Rob Rehard","x":"In addition, margins in the quarter were impacted by the ongoing impact of tariffs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/04/regal-beloit-rbc-q4-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"RBC 2019 Q4","e":"rbc","d":"2020-02-04","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Louis Pinkham","x":"Our product is well-differentiated, provides cost savings to our customers, improve productivity, safety and ergonomics and has a less than one-year payback.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/04/regal-beloit-rbc-q4-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"RBC 2019 Q4","e":"rbc","d":"2020-02-04","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Rob Rehard","x":"Our simplification and footprint consolidation activities resulted in $18.1 million of restructuring and related costs in the quarter.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/04/regal-beloit-rbc-q4-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"RBC 2020 Q1","e":"rbc","d":"2020-05-05","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Rob Rehard","x":"However, when comparing results in this segment on a year-over-year basis, which have been heavily impacted by tariffs, we should highlight the impact of the annual cost roll which affects the first quarter results of each year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/06/regal-beloit-rbc-q1-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"RBC 2020 Q1","e":"rbc","d":"2020-05-05","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Rob Rehard","x":"And similar to our Commercial segment, the year-over-year impact of the annual cost roll as the Industrial segment was most impacted by tariffs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/06/regal-beloit-rbc-q1-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"RBC 2020 Q1","e":"rbc","d":"2020-05-05","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Louis Pinkham","x":"Also on the topic of cost, I'd like to remind you that we're in the fortunate position of having recently launched a wide range of multiyear cost-reduction actions which we outlined at our March 3 Investor Day.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/06/regal-beloit-rbc-q1-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"RBC 2020 Q1","e":"rbc","d":"2020-05-05","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Louis Pinkham","x":"…outlined, we're in a position to be proactive to accelerate 2020 actions or pull forward some of the actions we had planned for 2021, and now believe we can accelerate approximately $3 million of cost savings originally slated for 2021 into this year, bringing the total to $32 million in 2020.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/06/regal-beloit-rbc-q1-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"RBC 2020 Q1","e":"rbc","d":"2020-05-05","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Louis Pinkham","x":"Given the low visibility around factors such as these, we're withdrawing our 2020 guidance.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/06/regal-beloit-rbc-q1-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"RBC 2020 Q4","e":"rbc","d":"2021-02-18","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Louis V. Pinkham","x":"We do think January got a boost from some buying ahead of price increases.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/18/regal-beloit-corp-rbc-q4-2020-earnings-call-transc/"},{"c":"RBC 2020 Q4","e":"rbc","d":"2021-02-18","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Robert J. Rehard","x":"That said, we believe some of the strength in January is tied to stocking in response to concerns about tightness in global supply chain, along with some customers buying ahead of anticipated price increases.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/18/regal-beloit-corp-rbc-q4-2020-earnings-call-transc/"},{"c":"RBC 2020 Q4","e":"rbc","d":"2021-02-18","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Louis V. Pinkham","x":"We continue to see improvements tied to our 80/20 initiatives and our multiyear restructuring programs, which help drive our fourth quarter adjusted gross margin up 110 basis points versus the prior year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/18/regal-beloit-corp-rbc-q4-2020-earnings-call-transc/"},{"c":"RBC 2020 Q4","e":"rbc","d":"2021-02-18","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Louis V. Pinkham","x":"We also realized improvements at the adjusted operating margin level, posting a year-over-year gain of 240 basis points in the fourth quarter, reflecting benefits of our restructuring actions, volume, mix and favorable net material costs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/18/regal-beloit-corp-rbc-q4-2020-earnings-call-transc/"},{"c":"RBC 2021 Q1","e":"rbc","d":"2021-05-04","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Louis V. Pinkham","x":"We are successfully transitioning to our TeraMAX product line of industrial motors out of Mexico that are -- that's much better cost position as well as not dealing with the tariffs, the product coming into China.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/05/04/regal-beloit-corp-rbc-q1-2021-earnings-call-transc/"},{"c":"RBC 2021 Q1","e":"rbc","d":"2021-05-04","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Louis V. Pinkham","x":"Regarding inflation, we're using our hedge program and buy ahead strategies, material price formulas and thoughtfully implemented price increases, guided by 80/20 to work toward price cost neutrality for the year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/05/04/regal-beloit-corp-rbc-q1-2021-earnings-call-transc/"},{"c":"RBC 2021 Q1","e":"rbc","d":"2021-05-04","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Robert J. Rehard","x":"While we expect to benefit from additional price realization in the second quarter, we do see this lag as a headwind.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/05/04/regal-beloit-corp-rbc-q1-2021-earnings-call-transc/"},{"c":"RBC 2021 Q1","e":"rbc","d":"2021-05-04","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Louis V. Pinkham","x":"…around the world for their hard work and resourcefulness as they remain focused on serving our customers, executing on our restructuring plan and cultivating growth opportunities, while continuing to battle COVID fatigue and maintaining our strict safety protocols to keep our workplace safe.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/05/04/regal-beloit-corp-rbc-q1-2021-earnings-call-transc/"},{"c":"RBC 2021 Q1","e":"rbc","d":"2021-05-04","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Louis V. Pinkham","x":"The addition of improving volumes, a steady cadence of progress on our 80/20 initiatives, executing our pre-COVID multiyear restructuring program and even some early gains from our efforts around lean, resulted in significant first quarter of margin expansion.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/05/04/regal-beloit-corp-rbc-q1-2021-earnings-call-transc/"},{"c":"RBC 2021 Q2","e":"rbc","d":"2021-07-29","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Louis V. Pinkham","x":"But we also, because of the tariffs that were put in place, we transitioned a significant amount of production from China into Mexico.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/07/29/regal-beloit-corp-rbc-q2-2021-earnings-call-transc/"},{"c":"RBC 2021 Q2","e":"rbc","d":"2021-07-29","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Robert J. Rehard","x":"While our two-way material price formulas continue to lag material inflation in the quarter, we saw noncontracted price increases helped bridge the gap so that we ended in a neutral price cost position for the quarter.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/07/29/regal-beloit-corp-rbc-q2-2021-earnings-call-transc/"},{"c":"RBC 2021 Q2","e":"rbc","d":"2021-07-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Louis V. Pinkham","x":"So before getting into more detail on our second quarter results, I want to thank all my Regal colleagues around the world for their hard work and resourcefulness as they remain focused on serving our customers, executing on our restructuring plans, and cultivating new growth opportunities.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/07/29/regal-beloit-corp-rbc-q2-2021-earnings-call-transc/"},{"c":"RBC 2021 Q2","e":"rbc","d":"2021-07-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Louis V. Pinkham","x":"The addition of sizable volume gains, a steady cadence of progress on our 80/20 productivity initiatives, executing our multiyear restructuring program and gains from our efforts around Lean resulted in significant second quarter margin expansion.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/07/29/regal-beloit-corp-rbc-q2-2021-earnings-call-transc/"},{"c":"RBC 2021 Q3","e":"rbc","d":"2021-11-02","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Robert J. Rehard","x":"Operating margin in the quarter for PTS was 18.8%, up 600 basis points compared to the prior year, very strong performance aided by volume, price and permanent restructuring actions.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/11/02/regal-beloit-corp-rbc-q3-2021-earnings-call-transc/"},{"c":"RBC 2021 Q3","e":"rbc","d":"2021-11-02","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Louis V. Pinkham","x":"…them daily, but we're also being disciplined about our execution on our organic growth and restructuring programs, pursuing PMC merger synergies, embedding capital deployment opportunities, as we think about how best to leverage our clean balance sheet and strong cash flow to keep…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/11/02/regal-beloit-corp-rbc-q3-2021-earnings-call-transc/"},{"c":"RBC 2026 Q3","e":"rbc","d":"2026-02-05","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Ross Sparenblek","x":"I mean, was it more cost out and what is kind of maybe the revised outlook on where those margins can go?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/05/rbc-bearings-rbc-q3-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"RBC 2027 Q2","e":"rbc","d":"2026-10-30","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Robert Sullivan","x":"You know, I think last quarter, we increased our outlook for the year from 50 to 100 basis points of margin expansion for the full year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/10/30/rbc-bearings-rbc-q2-2027-earnings-call-transcript/"}],"trends":{"theater":[[35,1,6841,0,0,0,5756,645],[36,1,8521,0,0,0,6815,1211],[37,1,9693,0,0,0,8189,1175],[38,1,7596,0,0,0,5762,1505],[39,1,8647,0,0,0,6892,1329],[40,1,6728,0,0,0,5670,732],[41,1,8597,0,0,0,7810,514],[44,1,6550,0,0,0,5691,604],[45,1,6829,0,0,0,5623,894],[46,1,7385,0,0,0,6044,1009],[47,1,8432,0,0,0,6956,1091],[63,1,5519,0,0,0,3531,1541],[64,1,5173,0,0,0,1006,3886],[65,1,4692,0,0,0,1090,2964],[67,1,5974,0,0,0,1792,3658]],"cinema":[[35,1,6841,0,0,0,5756,645],[36,1,8521,0,0,0,6815,1211],[37,1,9693,0,0,0,8189,1175],[38,1,7596,0,0,0,5762,1505],[39,1,8647,0,0,0,6892,1329],[40,1,6728,0,0,0,5670,732],[41,1,8597,0,0,0,7810,514],[44,1,6550,0,0,0,5691,604],[45,1,6829,0,0,0,5623,894],[46,1,7385,0,0,0,6044,1009],[47,1,8432,0,0,0,6956,1091],[63,1,5519,0,0,0,3531,1541],[64,1,5173,0,0,0,1006,3886],[65,1,4692,0,0,0,1090,2964],[67,1,5974,0,0,0,1792,3658]],"imax":[[35,1,6841,0,0,0,5756,645],[36,1,8521,0,0,0,6815,1211],[37,1,9693,0,0,0,8189,1175],[38,1,7596,0,0,0,5762,1505],[39,1,8647,0,0,0,6892,1329],[40,1,6728,0,0,0,5670,732],[41,1,8597,0,0,0,7810,514],[44,1,6550,0,0,0,5691,604],[45,1,6829,0,0,0,5623,894],[46,1,7385,0,0,0,6044,1009],[47,1,8432,0,0,0,6956,1091],[63,1,5519,0,0,0,3531,1541],[64,1,5173,0,0,0,1006,3886],[65,1,4692,0,0,0,1090,2964],[67,1,5974,0,0,